  "content": "<h1>Tschipcraft 的更好的火焰粒子</h1><p>&gt; 適用於 1.14x-26.2x 的資源包</p><h2>特色</h2><p><em>見證火焰舞動閃爍的迷人動畫。</em></p><p>此資源包將火焰、靈魂火焰和銅火焰粒子替換為動畫版本。</p><h2>預覽</h2><p><img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo_scaled.gif\" alt=\"火焰粒子\"> <img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo2_scaled.gif\" alt=\"靈魂火焰粒子\"> <img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/better-flame-particles/demo3_scaled.gif\" alt=\"銅火焰粒子\"></p><h2>安裝方式</h2><p>下載最新版本，將資源包 .zip 檔案放入您的 <code>resourcepacks</code> 資料夾，並在遊戲中啟用它。</p><h2>相容性</h2><p>此資源包會覆蓋火焰粒子。非原版風格的資源包與其搭配時可能會顯得不協調。 <img src=\"https://tschipo.alwaysdata.net/assets/supported?untested_versions=26.2x&amp;supported_versions=1.14x,1.15x,1.16x,1.17x,1.18x,1.19x,1.20x,1.21x,26.1x&amp;total_versions=1.13x,1.14x,1.15x,1.16x,1.17x,1.18x,1.19x,1.20x,1.21x,26.1x,26.2x&amp;icons=true&amp;platform=curseforge\" alt=\"支援版本\"></p><h2>外部連結</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-flame-particles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://gistcdn.githack.com/Tschipcraft/452c07c3fc13361faa37e90d1262e4f7/raw/668cdb7776499728664beca45bd00227146f2b3f/modrinth-dark.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fbetter-flame-particles%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/images/layout/favicon-32.png\" alt=\"PlanetMinecraft\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fC0C5HEJB2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a></p><h2>合作夥伴優惠</h2><p>想購買 <strong>Hytale</strong> 或升級您的版本嗎？結帳時使用創作者代碼 <code>Tschipcraft</code>，我將獲得佣金！（您的價格保持不變）</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2611\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https:/